The plate looks like a paper plate of about 20 cm (it spans roughly 260 px). The apple spans about 130 px, so its diameter is roughly 10 cm. That is a large apple, though from overhead it may look a bit bigger than it is. A 7.5–8 cm apple would weigh about 180–220 g, and a 9–10 cm one closer to 250 g. I'll estimate about 230 g.

At roughly 0.52 kcal/g, 230 g comes to about 120 kcal.

